  diseaseName: "Th\u1EA5t di\u1EC7t tr\xF9ng \u0111\u1ED9c (D\u1ECBch h\u1EA1ch th\u1EC3
    ph\u1ED5i nan y)"
  diseaseLevel: 5
  diseaseGroup: 0
  description: "D\u1ECBch \u0111\u1ED9c m\u1EA1nh ph\u1EA1m ph\u1EBF v\xE0 huy\u1EBFt
    m\u1EA1ch, nhi\u1EC7t \u0111\u1ED9c lan s\xE2u l\xE0m ch\xEDnh kh\xED suy tho\xE1t."
  patientDialogue: "Th\u1EA7y \u01A1i c\u1EE9u m\u1EA1ng... trong l\xE0ng t\xF4i
    ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u1EBFt la li\u1EC7t r\u1ED3i... t\xF4i th\u1EDF kh\xF4ng ra
    h\u01A1i, ng\u1EF1c \u0111au nh\u01B0 l\u1EEDa \u0111\u1ED1t, kh\u1EA1c to\xE0n
    m\xE1u \u0111en tanh h\xF4i, h\u1EA1ch c\u1ED5 s\u01B0ng to c\u1EE9ng ng\u1EAFc
    s\u1EAFp v\u1EE1 r\u1ED3i!"
  symptoms:
  - symptomText: "S\u1ED1t cao \u0111\xF9ng \u0111\xF9ng, co gi\u1EADt to\xE0n th\xE2n."
    showAtStep: 0
  - symptomText: "Ho li\xEAn t\u1EE5c tr\xE0o m\xE1u \u0111en \u0111\u1EB7c h\xF4i
      th\u1ED1i."
    showAtStep: 0
  - symptomText: "H\u1EA1ch c\u1ED5 v\xF9ng d\u01B0\u1EDBi tai s\u01B0ng to d\xEDnh
      th\xE0nh ch\xF9m."
    showAtStep: 1
  - symptomText: "Th\u1EA7n tr\xED m\xEA s\u1EA3ng, h\u01A1i th\u1EDF \u0111\u1EE9t
      qu\xE3ng s\u1EAFp tuy\u1EC7t."
    showAtStep: 1
